{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["讚美的禱告"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華是我的光，我的拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還怕誰？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是我的堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還怕誰？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人前來吞吃我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵來攻擊我時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必失足跌倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然大軍圍攻我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心中卻一無所懼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然戰爭來臨，我仍滿懷信心。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向耶和華求一件事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還要求，就是能一生住在祂的殿中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裡瞻仰祂的榮美，尋求祂的旨意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"危難之時，祂庇護我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我藏在祂的帳幕裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高高地安置在磐石上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要昂首面對四圍的敵人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在祂的帳幕裡歡呼獻祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌頌讚美祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你垂聽我的呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你恩待我，應允我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你說：「來尋求我的面！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心中響應：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華啊，我要尋求你的面。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別掩面不理我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別憤然拒絕你的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你一向是我的幫助。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救我的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別離開我，別撇棄我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"縱使父母撇棄我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華也必收留我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你指教我行你的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因仇敵環伺，求你引導我走坦途。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要把我交給仇敵，遂其所願，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們誣告我，恐嚇我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"我深信今世必能看見耶和華的美善。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要等候耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要剛強壯膽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候耶和華。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}